# TideClock needs NO environment variables and NO configuration.
#
# The tide/moon/harbor models, the station table, and the harmonic constituents
# are embedded in tideclock.py. There are no API keys, no database URLs, no
# secrets, and no ports (the tool is a command line program, not a server).
#
# This file is committed only so the repository layout is predictable.
# Copying it changes nothing:
#
#   cp .env.example .env      # optional, and functionally a no-op
